{"displayStem":"천식 환자가 급성 악화로 치료 중이다. 두 시점 모두 최대 호기 노력과 측정 기술을 확인하였다. 호흡음의 변화가 호전을 뜻하는지 평가한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 독립 작성 모의자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c10-visual\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"치료 경과 (min)와 최대호기유량 (L/min)\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">치료 중 추적</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"49\">최대호기유량 (L/min)</text><path d=\"M70 60V260H490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M70 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M175 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"175\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><path d=\"M280 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"280\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><path d=\"M385 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"385\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><path d=\"M490 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"490\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path d=\"M65 260h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M65 160h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"end\">150</text><path d=\"M65 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"end\">300</text><polyline points=\"70,120 175,146.66666666666669 280,180 385,206.66666666666666\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"120\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"146.66666666666669\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"180\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"385\" cy=\"206.66666666666666\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"80\" y=\"313\">━ 최대호기유량</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\">치료 경과 (min)</text></svg></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>시작</th><th>45분</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>천명</td><td>크게 들림</td><td>거의 들리지 않음</td></tr><tr><td>흉곽 운동</td><td>보조근 사용</td><td>얕은 운동·보조근 피로</td></tr><tr><td>말하기·의식</td><td>구절·명료</td><td>낱말·졸림</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}